{"seq":8,"slug":"immunology","title":"免疫学","stage":"DONE","category":"biology-life-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/biology-life-science/immunology","rating":{"composite":4.14,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 免疫学：防御系统的分子逻辑\n\n## Hub 定位\n\n本 Hub 系统梳理免疫系统从基础机制到临床转化的核心知识。与同 category 下的「微生物学」关注病原体本身的分类与致病机制不同，本 Hub 聚焦宿主一侧——免疫系统如何识别、响应和记忆入侵者。与「分子生物学」的边界在于，本 Hub 以免疫细胞和免疫分子的功能网络为主线，而非通用的基因表达与信号转导机制。\n\n## 学习路径\n\n本 Hub 包含四个章节，前后逻辑递进，建议顺序学习：\n\n**第一章「固有免疫」** 介绍机体的第一道和第二道防线——上皮屏障、吞噬细胞（巨噬细胞、中性粒细胞）、自然杀伤细胞、补体系统，以及模式识别受体（TLR、NLR）介导的炎症反应。这是免疫系统在感染后数分钟至数小时内的快速响应层，也是理解后续适应性免疫的必要前提。\n\n**第二章「适应性免疫」** 深入阐述特异性免疫的核心——T 细胞（辅助性、细胞毒性、调节性）和 B 细胞的发育、活化与效应机制，V(D)J 重组产生抗体多样性的分子基础，MHC 分子的抗原呈递，以及免疫记忆的形成原理。这是免疫学最精巧的部分，也是后续两章的理论基石。\n\n**第三章「免疫疾病」** 探讨免疫系统功能失调的病理后果——自身免疫病的发病机制（分子模拟、交叉反应）、先天性与获得性免疫缺陷的分类（如 SCID、AIDS），以及各型超敏反应（I-IV 型）的免疫病理学基础。理解正常机制后再看病理，能更深刻地领悟免疫调控的精密与脆弱。\n\n**第四章「应用免疫学」** 聚焦临床转化——疫苗设计的免疫学策略（减毒、亚单位、mRNA）、免疫检查点抑制剂（PD-1/CTLA-4）与 CAR-T 细胞疗法的原理，以及移植排斥反应的免疫学机制与免疫抑制方案。\n\n四章形成「正常防御 → 精密调控 → 失调病理 → 临床应用」的完整认知链条，跳读会造成概念断层。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 需要分子生物学的基本概念（蛋白质结构、基因表达、信号转导）\n- 了解微生物学中病原体的基本分类有助于理解免疫应答的对象\n- 高中生物学水平（细胞结构、DNA）是最低起点\n\n## 延伸阅读\n\n- [微生物学](../07_microbiology/) — 免疫系统的「对手」——病原微生物的分类、致病机制与宿主-病原互作\n- [分子生物学](../01_molecular-biology/) — 免疫分子（抗体、TCR、细胞因子）的结构与功能依赖分子生物学基础\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"innate-immunity","title":"固有免疫","docCount":3,"url":"/h/biology-life-science/immunology/innate-immunity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"physical-and-chemical-barriers","title":"物理与化学屏障","url":"/h/biology-life-science/immunology/innate-immunity/physical-and-chemical-barriers"},{"seq":2,"slug":"innate-immune-cells","title":"固有免疫细胞","url":"/h/biology-life-science/immunology/innate-immunity/innate-immune-cells"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pattern-recognition-and-inflammation","title":"模式识别与炎症反应","url":"/h/biology-life-science/immunology/innate-immunity/pattern-recognition-and-inflammation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"adaptive-immunity","title":"适应性免疫","docCount":3,"url":"/h/biology-life-science/immunology/adaptive-immunity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"t-cell-biology","title":"T 细胞生物学","url":"/h/biology-life-science/immunology/adaptive-immunity/t-cell-biology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"b-cells-and-antibodies","title":"B 细胞与抗体","url":"/h/biology-life-science/immunology/adaptive-immunity/b-cells-and-antibodies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"immunological-memory","title":"免疫记忆","url":"/h/biology-life-science/immunology/adaptive-immunity/immunological-memory"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"immune-disorders","title":"免疫疾病","docCount":3,"url":"/h/biology-life-science/immunology/immune-disorders","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"autoimmune-diseases","title":"自身免疫病","url":"/h/biology-life-science/immunology/immune-disorders/autoimmune-diseases"},{"seq":2,"slug":"immunodeficiency","title":"免疫缺陷","url":"/h/biology-life-science/immunology/immune-disorders/immunodeficiency"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hypersensitivity-and-allergy","title":"超敏反应与过敏","url":"/h/biology-life-science/immunology/immune-disorders/hypersensitivity-and-allergy"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applied-immunology","title":"应用免疫学","docCount":3,"url":"/h/biology-life-science/immunology/applied-immunology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vaccines-and-vaccination","title":"疫苗与免疫接种","url":"/h/biology-life-science/immunology/applied-immunology/vaccines-and-vaccination"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cancer-immunotherapy","title":"肿瘤免疫治疗","url":"/h/biology-life-science/immunology/applied-immunology/cancer-immunotherapy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"transplantation-immunology","title":"移植免疫学","url":"/h/biology-life-science/immunology/applied-immunology/transplantation-immunology"}]}]}